{"unit_id":"bingomu__readable-diagrams#card-zh","repo":"bingomu/readable-diagrams","commit":"976ef05e4ff103d7fea785aea2cc9b0d8f925234","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"readable-diagrams 是面向 DSH 及其他可读取 SKILL.md 的 agent 的图表制作技能：在 DSH 中注册后，agent 可按 JSON 规范生成独立 HTML 图页。它支持架构、流程、状态、时序、时间线、树形、分层、条形图和象限图，也提供 Mermaid、draw.io、Excalidraw 内容提取及 SVG、PNG 导出。页面配有标题、结论摘要、阅读路径、图例和说明，并可用结构及可读性检查器验证。适合需要把系统、流程或比较关系整理成易读图页的使用者；不需要 API Key，运行脚本需 Python 3.9+，DSH 包装器需 Node.js 20+。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:73-103","skills/readable-diagrams/scripts/render.py:1-14","skills/readable-diagrams/scripts/comprehension_check.py:1-17","skills/readable-diagrams/references/import-export.md:1-20"]}
